# Build-artifact backups (e.g. dist.pre-fixa-2026-07-28.CONTAINS-P1-BUG.bak/).
# The existing "dist/" rule does not cover these; this repo is PUBLIC and they are
# known-buggy compiled output with no reason to ship.
dist.*.bak/

# Raw paid-response captures. A future capture tool that records REQUEST HEADERS
# would embed an X-PAYMENT value — an unsettled EIP-3009 transferWithAuthorization
# is replayable until spent. Ignored everywhere so every commit of one is a
# deliberate `git add -f` after a scan. Does NOT affect the four already tracked
# in d912f98 (founder-accepted 2026-09-02, scanned clean: no X-PAYMENT value, no
# request headers, no private-key shape); gitignore never applies to tracked files.
attestation-capture*.json
